WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:45.963
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

2
00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.383
Sir, it's okay

3
00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:52.761
take a deep breath slowly

4
00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:53.887
What did you say?

5
00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:56.807
The subway project has been delayed for a long time

6
00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:59.059
I heard that the store could not be sold for even 300 million won.

7
00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.477
They sold more than a billion

8
00:01:00.561 --> 00:01:03.355
What should I do? I might not be able to open that store.

9
00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:05.440
Oh, you don’t need to return the deposit.

10
00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:06.817
Goodbye

11
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.153
Never touch your severance pay. Leave it alone.

12
00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:12.781
If a person insists on doing something that is not suitable for him

13
00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:14.199
It will break down the body

14
00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:23.959
- Please get out of the way!
- Everyone, give in!

15
00:01:24.585 --> 00:01:25.919
What happened?

16
00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:30.674
How does it feel?

17
00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:33.719
- Better than before
- When will the family members arrive?

18
00:01:35.053 --> 00:01:36.013
I didn't notify anyone

19
00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:38.473
I should inform you
Can you go home alone?

20
00:01:38.557 --> 00:01:39.975
Okay, I can do it myself

21
00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:43.312
My heart just beats very fast suddenly

22
00:01:43.395 --> 00:01:46.940
My chest seems to be pressed by something.

23
00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:49.776
Am I having an arrhythmia or something?

24
00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:52.070
No, your test results show normal

25
00:01:52.154 --> 00:01:55.657
Blood tests and imaging tests
No organic problems were found

26
00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.703
These are symptoms of a panic attack

27
00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.788
Have you been under too much stress lately?

28
00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:02.831
What?

29
00:02:02.914 --> 00:02:04.333
Is this the first time?

30
00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:07.336
Or have you had similar symptoms before?

31
00:02:10.422 --> 00:02:11.840
Wish you a wonderful life Kim Nak-soo!

32
00:02:11.923 --> 00:02:13.634
Then why did the company treat him like this?

33
00:02:13.717 --> 00:02:14.593
Minister Kim!

34
00:02:16.178 --> 00:02:17.018
(Executive Director Bai Zhengtai)

35
00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.805
- Sorry
- It would be nice to have you as an errand boy.

36
00:02:18.889 --> 00:02:20.724
Otherwise, what else can you do?

37
00:02:25.437 --> 00:02:28.065
Why don't you go to the psychiatrist tomorrow?

38
00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.153
- Psychiatry?
- Do you want me to make an appointment for you?

39
00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:36.365
Book a psychiatry appointment?

40
00:03:09.773 --> 00:03:12.067
Come on, are you kidding me?

41
00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:14.986
I said I had trouble breathing

42
00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:17.906
You think I'm mentally ill

43
00:03:17.989 --> 00:03:19.783
What kind of doctor are you?

44
00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:20.951
please lower your voice

45
00:03:21.576 --> 00:03:22.703
Is there any mistake?

46
00:03:23.578 --> 00:03:25.706
Really, they said I was mentally ill

47
00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:27.207
Abominable

48
00:03:53.525 --> 00:03:54.401
lazy guy

49
00:03:54.484 --> 00:03:56.111
- You idiot!
- It hurts!

50
00:04:00.407 --> 00:04:01.324
lazy guy

51
00:04:03.118 --> 00:04:05.036
How much does it cost?

52
00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.079
One billion and fifty million won

53
00:04:06.872 --> 00:04:07.831
How much is the loan?

54
00:04:08.582 --> 00:04:09.458
Five hundred and fifty million

55
00:04:09.541 --> 00:04:11.793
- I really want to beat you to death!
- Stop fighting. You already fought.

56
00:04:14.713 --> 00:04:15.630
Does your wife know?

57
00:04:15.714 --> 00:04:16.798
Don't know yet

58
00:04:16.882 --> 00:04:20.427
How can anyone make such a decision?
You didn’t even discuss it with your wife?

59
00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:21.678
I was thinking

60
00:04:21.762 --> 00:04:23.472
I'll give her a big surprise when the franchise store opens.

61
00:04:23.555 --> 00:04:26.808
Are people out of their minds?
How could you settle in a place like this?

62
00:04:27.434 --> 00:04:30.061
Didn’t I tell you not to touch your retirement pay?

63
00:04:30.145 --> 00:04:31.480
I'm so angry

64
00:04:31.563 --> 00:04:33.690
Do you think it’s easy to make money from a shop?

65
00:04:33.774 --> 00:04:36.234
"If you want to kill your enemy, persuade him to buy a shop."

66
00:04:36.318 --> 00:04:38.028
I don’t say this for nothing

67
00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:41.114
Clearly knowing there is a trap
You should have stopped me with all your strength then.

68
00:04:41.198 --> 00:04:42.991
Then do you want me to hit you "hard" now?

69
00:04:43.867 --> 00:04:45.076
Is it really impossible to rent it out?

70
00:04:45.702 --> 00:04:47.370
Oh my god

71
00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.749
Just wait a minute and I'll go and inquire about it too.

72
00:04:52.375 --> 00:04:54.669
Don't think about carrying it alone

73
00:04:54.753 --> 00:04:55.837
Tell your wife quickly

74
00:04:57.047 --> 00:04:58.340
No

75
00:04:58.423 --> 00:05:01.635
- You have to do it even if you don’t. If you don’t say it, it will be over.
- No, really.

76
00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:03.720
- I can't say
- Really terrible

77
00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:11.645
{\an8}Episode 9: The Biggest Enemy

78
00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:23.782
{\an8}What are you doing?

79
00:05:25.909 --> 00:05:26.785
{\an8}Husband

80
00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:29.746
{\an8}Oh

81
00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.498
{\an8}Have you forgotten your password?

82
00:05:31.581 --> 00:05:33.208
{\an8}No

83
00:05:33.834 --> 00:05:35.168
{\an8}Have you been drinking?

84
00:05:35.252 --> 00:05:37.087
{\an8}What are you drinking? No, I just...

85
00:05:37.629 --> 00:05:40.382
{\an8}What is that? Are you becoming more and more forgetful?

86
00:05:40.465 --> 00:05:42.092
{\an8}I’m just getting older.

87
00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.391
{\an8}- Husband
- What?

88
00:05:52.769 --> 00:05:54.229
I signed my first contract today

89
00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:57.232
- Really?
- Awesome, right?

90
00:05:58.942 --> 00:06:01.111
Good guy. Really?

91
00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:02.571
great

92
00:06:02.654 --> 00:06:03.989
- Come sit here
- OK

93
00:06:05.115 --> 00:06:06.199
This time

94
00:06:06.867 --> 00:06:08.076
I earned 60,000 won

95
00:06:10.036 --> 00:06:11.162
Sixty thousand?

96
00:06:11.246 --> 00:06:13.206
It's a single room with a cheap deposit.

97
00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.584
The company takes 60%, I take 40%

98
00:06:16.877 --> 00:06:17.752
Very little money

99
00:06:19.337 --> 00:06:21.506
What does it mean to have little money?

100
00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.633
This is what you earned hard

101
00:06:24.676 --> 00:06:26.553
- Are you serious?
- Of course

102
00:06:26.636 --> 00:06:29.264
Do you want to frame it and hang it on the wall?

103
00:06:30.181 --> 00:06:32.392
You are exaggerating too

104
00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:35.687
Let's order fried chicken

105
00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:36.730
my treat

106
00:06:38.148 --> 00:06:40.191
No, let me buy it

107
00:06:40.734 --> 00:06:42.110
What about you?

108
00:06:42.193 --> 00:06:43.069
Me what?

109
00:06:43.153 --> 00:06:45.238
Didn't you say you wanted to tell me something this morning?

110
00:06:49.451 --> 00:06:50.911
Just...

111
00:06:50.994 --> 00:06:53.121
Today is a big day. You signed your first contract.

112
00:06:53.204 --> 00:06:55.582
I'll tell you about that later

113
00:06:56.583 --> 00:06:57.792
What should I order?

114
00:06:57.876 --> 00:07:01.254
The fried chicken fresh out of the pan is the most fragrant.

115
00:07:01.338 --> 00:07:03.256
That's good, okay

116
00:07:03.924 --> 00:07:05.759
Give it to me, I'll do it

117
00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:10.096
Order the fried chicken and fries

118
00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:12.933
And cheese. You can’t miss cheese.

119
00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:38.458
(Plastic Glass Cans Styrofoam)

120
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:40.919
Really 103 buildings...

121
00:07:41.002 --> 00:07:42.253
Sir, how can I get to Building 103?

122
00:07:43.088 --> 00:07:44.881
Go that way and turn left

123
00:07:44.965 --> 00:07:45.840
Got it thank you

124
00:07:49.219 --> 00:07:51.179
Hello, I'm so sorry. I'm just in front.

125
00:07:51.262 --> 00:07:52.722
I'll be there soon. Sorry

126
00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.528
Husband, go take out the trash later.

127
00:08:06.611 --> 00:08:09.280
I've already divided it into categories
You can just take it and throw it away, okay?

128
00:08:09.364 --> 00:08:10.740
OK

129
00:08:10.824 --> 00:08:12.033
- I'm leaving
- OK

130
00:08:12.117 --> 00:08:13.243
I'm leaving too

131
00:08:14.911 --> 00:08:15.996
(incoming call)

132
00:08:16.079 --> 00:08:17.122
Hello?

133
00:08:17.205 --> 00:08:19.541
This is the Medical Department of Sung Hyun General Hospital

134
00:08:19.624 --> 00:08:22.544
Did you go to the emergency room yesterday afternoon?
Mr. Kim Nak-soo?

135
00:08:22.627 --> 00:08:23.628
it's me

136
00:08:23.712 --> 00:08:25.755
You left without paying the fee

137
00:08:25.839 --> 00:08:27.966
Can you come over today to make up the payment?

138
00:08:28.049 --> 00:08:29.676
Okay, no problem. Oh my god.

139
00:08:32.721 --> 00:08:34.305
- let's go
- OK

140
00:08:34.389 --> 00:08:36.808
The total is 218,000 won. You can pay it now.

141
00:08:39.144 --> 00:08:40.061
- Please swipe your card
- OK

142
00:08:42.439 --> 00:08:45.233
Will "Emergency Room" appear on the bill?

143
00:08:45.316 --> 00:08:48.611
Yes it will appear as
"Sunghyun General Hospital Emergency Center"

144
00:08:49.446 --> 00:08:50.780
In that case

145
00:08:51.281 --> 00:08:52.699
I'd better pay cash

146
00:09:07.172 --> 00:09:08.381
(Sey Bank Deposits and Withdrawals)

147
00:09:09.674 --> 00:09:13.678
The odd deposit and round withdrawal account is 2.2 million

148
00:09:13.762 --> 00:09:15.638
The salary account is 900,000

149
00:09:16.514 --> 00:09:20.685
The fixed and live account is 1.8 million
And in my payment software

150
00:09:20.769 --> 00:09:23.980
Money that needs to be paid immediately...

151
00:09:27.859 --> 00:09:28.943
(Credit card payment pending)

152
00:09:29.027 --> 00:09:31.029
(Korean National Health Insurance is pending...)

153
00:09:31.696 --> 00:09:33.114
"630,000..."

154
00:09:34.532 --> 00:09:36.242
(Health insurance: 630600
Total:299930)

155
00:09:40.497 --> 00:09:41.456
mine

156
00:09:42.373 --> 00:09:44.209
life savings

157
00:09:44.834 --> 00:09:47.003
Only 290,000 won

158
00:09:49.464 --> 00:09:51.800
I can’t even pay the first month’s interest.

159
00:09:55.178 --> 00:09:56.096
Oh my god

160
00:10:06.606 --> 00:10:07.482
wait a moment

161
00:10:07.565 --> 00:10:08.505
(Securities account: 20035800)

162
00:10:09.484 --> 00:10:10.360
Right

163
00:10:10.944 --> 00:10:12.362
What about the security deposit?

164
00:10:12.445 --> 00:10:13.571
Twenty million

165
00:10:14.197 --> 00:10:17.117
Why are they fabricating
A non-existent toast shop lease

166
00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:20.078
Do you have to give me 20 million won?

167
00:10:20.703 --> 00:10:23.790
Maybe they need to buy time

168
00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:26.042
Let me relax my guard

169
00:10:26.126 --> 00:10:28.753
I took the opportunity to clear out the sales office and then disappeared.

170
00:10:28.837 --> 00:10:30.505
I'm making a call. Keep your voice down.

171
00:10:33.466 --> 00:10:34.676
- Hello?
- Hello boss

172
00:10:34.759 --> 00:10:36.052
Have you been doing well recently?

173
00:10:36.553 --> 00:10:38.888
There is a store that wants to sign a contract, so I would like to contact you specifically.

174
00:10:38.972 --> 00:10:41.850
And they also need
a legal security barrier

175
00:10:41.933 --> 00:10:45.228
Thank you so much. We will do a good job.

176
00:10:45.311 --> 00:10:47.105
You're welcome. I'm glad to rent it to you.

177
00:10:47.188 --> 00:10:48.356
- thank you
- thank you

178
00:10:49.566 --> 00:10:51.192
- Please
- Pleasant to work with

179
00:10:51.276 --> 00:10:52.861
- thank you
- thank you

180
00:10:55.572 --> 00:10:57.031
Thank you for your hard work, both of you.

181
00:10:57.657 --> 00:10:58.575
thank you

182
00:10:58.658 --> 00:11:01.828
Damn, just give me this much?
He paid one billion and fifty million

183
00:11:01.911 --> 00:11:04.706
After it's done, I'll treat you to some Korean beef, okay?

184
00:11:04.789 --> 00:11:07.834
What? What are you talking about?
We have signed the contract

185
00:11:07.917 --> 00:11:11.462
I'm very sorry that the store can't open.

186
00:11:11.546 --> 00:11:13.256
You can't quit suddenly now...

187
00:11:13.339 --> 00:11:15.633
- This guy is so annoying.
- hang up directly

188
00:11:15.717 --> 00:11:17.802
What about the security deposit?

189
00:11:19.095 --> 00:11:21.222
Oh, you don’t need to return the deposit.

190
00:11:21.306 --> 00:11:22.974
Goodbye

191
00:11:23.474 --> 00:11:26.603
As long as they give up their deposit, it's not fraud.

192
00:11:26.686 --> 00:11:29.230
It’s just the tenant’s unilateral remorse.

193
00:11:29.314 --> 00:11:32.734
Okay, everyone, give me your mobile phone cards.

194
00:11:33.526 --> 00:11:34.694
give him

195
00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.949
Those bastards took away 700-800 million won

196
00:11:40.033 --> 00:11:41.367
The 20 million you threw at me...

197
00:11:44.245 --> 00:11:45.663
Just let go and play!

198
00:11:48.082 --> 00:11:52.003
But in this perfect crime
The most cost-effective expense

199
00:12:00.511 --> 00:12:02.180
(Total: 299930)

200
00:12:20.198 --> 00:12:22.450
Damn it

201
00:12:26.079 --> 00:12:27.080
Damn it

202
00:12:28.623 --> 00:12:30.375
Should be arriving soon

203
00:12:30.875 --> 00:12:32.543
Are you sure you made the right move?

204
00:12:33.628 --> 00:12:36.172
- Let me see
- I have to get this business done and pay off the loan.

205
00:12:36.256 --> 00:12:38.758
Pay back the money you owe dad as soon as possible

206
00:12:41.219 --> 00:12:42.136
(Say goodbye to ordinary T-shirts)

207
00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:43.721
(Express your own creativity)

208
00:12:48.559 --> 00:12:49.644
welcome

209
00:12:49.727 --> 00:12:50.895
- Hello
- We are on sale

210
00:12:50.979 --> 00:12:52.313
- Really?
- take a look

211
00:12:52.397 --> 00:12:53.564
Sorry

212
00:12:53.648 --> 00:12:55.233
- Hannah, let's go
- What? OK

213
00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:56.567
- Welcome again
- OK

214
00:12:58.945 --> 00:13:01.572
I mean, we can't let them send samples over.

215
00:13:01.656 --> 00:13:03.658
Shall we call to place an order?

216
00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.078
I would like to compare different fabrics in person

217
00:13:07.745 --> 00:13:09.580
If possible, you still have to bargain.

218
00:13:10.415 --> 00:13:11.916
Will you?

219
00:13:12.542 --> 00:13:14.961
Of course, every penny must be calculated carefully.

220
00:13:15.044 --> 00:13:16.838
After all, this is money paid by my father

221
00:13:16.921 --> 00:13:18.756
No matter what, we have to proceed with caution

222
00:13:21.884 --> 00:13:22.927
right here

223
00:13:24.262 --> 00:13:27.181
Is this fabric good?

224
00:13:27.265 --> 00:13:28.182
yes

225
00:13:29.309 --> 00:13:32.228
I still don't see the benefit

226
00:13:33.396 --> 00:13:36.774
Since the fabric is of high quality, the printing effect is also good

227
00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.901
I want to place an order

228
00:13:38.985 --> 00:13:39.986
What?

229
00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.072
Eighteen thousand won per item, right?

230
00:13:48.703 --> 00:13:51.581
We order 100 pieces of each color, 300 pieces in total

231
00:13:52.415 --> 00:13:53.499
How about sixteen thousand?

232
00:13:55.043 --> 00:13:57.545
If you order a thousand pieces
I can lower the unit price to 10,000

233
00:13:59.005 --> 00:14:01.299
- You said ten thousand?
- That's right

234
00:14:04.969 --> 00:14:07.555
Calm down and just order 300 pieces.

235
00:14:10.641 --> 00:14:12.143
If the purchase price is 10,000, order 1,000 pieces

236
00:14:12.769 --> 00:14:14.645
Even if each piece only sells for 30,000

237
00:14:15.897 --> 00:14:17.273
There are also 30 million

238
00:14:17.357 --> 00:14:19.359
This way I can pay my dad back right away.

239
00:14:19.442 --> 00:14:22.195
That's true, but you have to sell them all.

240
00:14:27.033 --> 00:14:29.285
Hana, are you a little confident about the shopping season at the end of the year?

241
00:14:31.496 --> 00:14:32.663
{\an8}(Love is here)

242
00:14:32.747 --> 00:14:34.457
Look, it says "Love is here"

243
00:14:37.043 --> 00:14:39.837
You mean I have to pack this stuff with you?
Work until the end of the year?

244
00:14:41.839 --> 00:14:42.965
If you don't want to

245
00:14:43.758 --> 00:14:45.510
Then we'll sell it quickly

246
00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:48.721
ok boss

247
00:14:49.722 --> 00:14:52.350
Four hundred pieces of each color, a total of one thousand two hundred pieces

248
00:14:53.309 --> 00:14:54.310
deal

249
00:14:54.977 --> 00:14:56.938
- OK
- thank you

250
00:14:57.021 --> 00:14:59.899
What a filial son
Bank transfers receive a 5% discount

251
00:14:59.982 --> 00:15:02.068
- Did you tell her?
- No

252
00:15:02.151 --> 00:15:03.611
Do you want me to tell her?

253
00:15:03.694 --> 00:15:06.823
“Soo Qian’s mom, your husband is now the landlord.

254
00:15:06.906 --> 00:15:09.117
But you know that building is..."

255
00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:12.286
Okay, I said I would tell her today.

256
00:15:13.788 --> 00:15:14.872
I have to hang up

257
00:15:22.588 --> 00:15:24.590
- Mr. Kim Nak-soo
- Yeah

258
00:15:25.341 --> 00:15:27.552
If someone comes home, why don't you say hello?

259
00:15:29.804 --> 00:15:30.721
you are back

260
00:15:35.977 --> 00:15:39.605
It must be very difficult to stuff these into the washing machine, right?

261
00:15:40.648 --> 00:15:41.524
sorry

262
00:15:43.985 --> 00:15:45.695
Just kidding you

263
00:15:46.529 --> 00:15:48.281
I negotiated two deals today

264
00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:50.825
That's 120,000?

265
00:15:51.576 --> 00:15:52.493
It’s 90,000

266
00:15:54.412 --> 00:15:56.372
Let's call it pizza then

267
00:15:56.456 --> 00:15:58.082
You order tonight

268
00:15:59.542 --> 00:16:00.543
What's wrong with you?

269
00:16:00.626 --> 00:16:01.502
What does it mean?

270
00:16:03.171 --> 00:16:04.464
I mean

271
00:16:04.547 --> 00:16:07.091
You've been acting weird since yesterday

272
00:16:07.175 --> 00:16:09.594
- What's wrong?
- Usually you would say

273
00:16:09.677 --> 00:16:11.554
"You work so hard to earn 90,000 a day?

274
00:16:11.637 --> 00:16:13.848
Not even the bus fare is enough”

275
00:16:14.682 --> 00:16:16.017
Are you sick?

276
00:16:18.478 --> 00:16:20.104
I have a stomachache

277
00:16:20.188 --> 00:16:21.898
I'm afraid you make more than me

278
00:16:21.981 --> 00:16:23.816
I feel so jealous that my stomach hurts

279
00:16:24.942 --> 00:16:25.943
It hurts so much

280
00:16:26.027 --> 00:16:28.404
Don't try to change the subject

281
00:16:28.488 --> 00:16:29.572
What happened?

282
00:16:34.952 --> 00:16:35.828
That...

283
00:16:44.003 --> 00:16:45.546
What happened?

284
00:16:47.256 --> 00:16:49.509
Oh, I really can’t hide anything from you

285
00:16:57.767 --> 00:17:00.394
I plan to meet Sang-cheol

286
00:17:02.188 --> 00:17:04.774
Why? You're not unwilling

287
00:17:04.857 --> 00:17:06.275
Join his company?

288
00:17:06.359 --> 00:17:08.653
No I've thought about it

289
00:17:08.736 --> 00:17:12.156
In the sales industry, it is inevitable to take detours in the early stages.

290
00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.450
So I thought it would be better to go to his company from the beginning.

291
00:17:14.534 --> 00:17:17.370
Help him grasp the direction

292
00:17:20.164 --> 00:17:21.082
Are you sure you can do it?

293
00:17:21.165 --> 00:17:24.001
What's wrong with that? We're a family

294
00:17:36.389 --> 00:17:37.723
{\an8}(Energy drink 20,000 won)

295
00:17:37.807 --> 00:17:39.475
{\an8}This is too expensive, right?

296
00:17:52.446 --> 00:17:54.240
- Total 8,800 won
- OK

297
00:17:54.323 --> 00:17:55.950
Does the communication company have any discounts?

298
00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:56.951
(Kim Nak-soo ACT)

299
00:17:57.034 --> 00:17:58.911
Sorry, only those with ACT do not enjoy the discount.

300
00:17:58.995 --> 00:18:00.580
- Sorry
- OK

301
00:18:01.831 --> 00:18:03.291
Do you need a plastic bag?

302
00:18:03.374 --> 00:18:04.250
(100 won each)

303
00:18:05.251 --> 00:18:07.211
Is there a charge for this? No thanks.

304
00:18:07.295 --> 00:18:08.170
- OK
- give

305
00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:17.888
(Wotech)

306
00:18:31.902 --> 00:18:35.239
The response speed is very smooth

307
00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.410
Brother-in-law, you came too late

308
00:18:39.493 --> 00:18:41.287
Probably so

309
00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:43.331
The connection always breaks

310
00:18:43.414 --> 00:18:44.498
I'll study it further

311
00:18:44.582 --> 00:18:45.458
- Take it
- OK

312
00:18:48.794 --> 00:18:51.005
I told you before

313
00:18:51.088 --> 00:18:52.006
look over there

314
00:18:54.925 --> 00:18:56.636
We already have a sales director

315
00:18:56.719 --> 00:18:58.971
- That's right
- Grassroots employees are also fully recruited

316
00:18:59.055 --> 00:19:02.433
There are really no vacancies in the sales department.

317
00:19:02.516 --> 00:19:03.559
hey

318
00:19:03.643 --> 00:19:05.561
- Hi Ha Young
-Brother-in-law, you are here

319
00:19:06.062 --> 00:19:08.898
Representative Han, Director Wen of Namo Communications will be here soon.

320
00:19:10.024 --> 00:19:11.233
Really? What should I do?

321
00:19:11.901 --> 00:19:14.278
Director Park, please entertain your brother-in-law first.

322
00:19:14.362 --> 00:19:15.863
ok?

323
00:19:16.405 --> 00:19:18.783
Brother-in-law, I’ll come as soon as I go

324
00:19:18.866 --> 00:19:20.701
- Get a bottle
- No thanks

325
00:19:37.009 --> 00:19:38.969
It feels like I'm interviewing you, brother-in-law.

326
00:19:40.346 --> 00:19:41.222
(Wotech Han Sang-cheol)

327
00:19:41.305 --> 00:19:42.348
Introduce yourself

328
00:19:44.266 --> 00:19:46.644
What are you doing here?

329
00:19:46.727 --> 00:19:49.230
I am a registered director of this company

330
00:19:49.313 --> 00:19:52.608
I transferred the enzyme group purchase business here
It brought a lot of profits

331
00:19:52.692 --> 00:19:54.527
I don't even know

332
00:19:57.321 --> 00:19:59.365
If you want to come, you should come early.

333
00:20:00.241 --> 00:20:01.242
Yes

334
00:20:03.077 --> 00:20:05.830
Brother-in-law, even if we want to work with you

335
00:20:06.455 --> 00:20:07.623
Now the staff is full

336
00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.960
It's really no joke
Not even an extra desk

337
00:20:14.004 --> 00:20:16.799
Sales relies on frequent customers

338
00:20:17.925 --> 00:20:19.802
Don't pay attention to these

339
00:20:20.553 --> 00:20:21.887
It doesn’t matter if you have a desk or not.

340
00:20:32.565 --> 00:20:34.191
- Borrow it
- OK

341
00:20:34.942 --> 00:20:36.819
- Please give way
- OK

342
00:20:37.987 --> 00:20:40.156
- Borrowed
- OK

343
00:20:41.115 --> 00:20:42.950
Sorry, I'll send it right away

344
00:20:44.869 --> 00:20:46.829
Oh my God, let me do it

345
00:20:47.538 --> 00:20:50.249
I feel really sorry to see you like this, brother-in-law.

346
00:20:50.332 --> 00:20:51.417
It's okay

347
00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.335
So you are familiar with the business

348
00:20:53.419 --> 00:20:55.337
Okay, you can observe it for a few days first

349
00:20:55.421 --> 00:20:57.965
Think about whether there is a job here that you can do

350
00:20:58.048 --> 00:20:59.675
OK

351
00:20:59.759 --> 00:21:02.386
If you have any questions about sales, just ask me

352
00:21:06.599 --> 00:21:08.392
Do you need my help?

353
00:21:08.476 --> 00:21:09.351
OK thank you

354
00:21:09.435 --> 00:21:10.478
- Ink...
- Sorry

355
00:21:10.561 --> 00:21:11.854
Could you please send this for me?

356
00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:13.981
- Send this?
- This is the address

357
00:21:14.064 --> 00:21:15.399
- thank you
- I have one to send too.

358
00:21:15.483 --> 00:21:16.442
What?

359
00:21:17.067 --> 00:21:18.360
- Shipping?
- I want to send it too

360
00:21:18.986 --> 00:21:20.070
OK

361
00:21:20.988 --> 00:21:22.490
- thank you
- You're welcome

362
00:21:24.283 --> 00:21:25.159
Send...

363
00:21:29.997 --> 00:21:32.416
(Wangzhen Shopping Center)

364
00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.294
(Sales Office of Wangzhen Shopping Center)

365
00:21:35.377 --> 00:21:37.588
(Zhongying Real Estate)

366
00:21:54.021 --> 00:21:55.147
Hey who's here?

367
00:21:55.231 --> 00:21:56.857
Come and sit

368
00:22:00.069 --> 00:22:01.821
- Dad, you're back
- Hello uncle.

369
00:22:01.904 --> 00:22:03.489
Why are you two here?

370
00:22:03.572 --> 00:22:05.616
Go check out Soo Gyom’s bedroom

371
00:22:05.699 --> 00:22:07.618
- Go check it out
- What?

372
00:22:08.327 --> 00:22:10.412
Oh my God, what are those?

373
00:22:10.496 --> 00:22:11.956
don't ask me

374
00:22:12.039 --> 00:22:13.999
Ask your son

375
00:22:14.083 --> 00:22:15.501
{\an8}(Love is here)

376
00:22:15.584 --> 00:22:16.460
What are those?

377
00:22:16.544 --> 00:22:18.462
These are the clothes we ordered

378
00:22:18.546 --> 00:22:20.089
- Clothes?
- Yes

379
00:22:20.172 --> 00:22:23.217
We're going to sell these hoodies online

380
00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:25.344
How many pieces did you get?

381
00:22:26.220 --> 00:22:28.013
A total of one thousand two hundred pieces

382
00:22:28.097 --> 00:22:30.349
- One thousand two hundred?
- Yes

383
00:22:30.432 --> 00:22:32.643
I also tried to persuade him

384
00:22:32.726 --> 00:22:35.813
But your son's attitude is very determined

385
00:22:35.896 --> 00:22:38.065
Wait a minute. Where did the money come from?

386
00:22:38.148 --> 00:22:41.902
Uncle helped us when we were in trouble...

387
00:22:41.986 --> 00:22:43.779
We got the investment

388
00:22:43.863 --> 00:22:46.782
- What?
- I helped a little bit

389
00:22:46.866 --> 00:22:49.577
I can get the business plan and the like in just a few clicks.

390
00:22:53.205 --> 00:22:55.082
-Are you feeling uncomfortable somewhere?
- What?

391
00:22:55.165 --> 00:22:57.751
Or are you hiding something from me?

392
00:22:58.711 --> 00:23:01.005
You've been doing weird things lately

393
00:23:01.088 --> 00:23:04.300
It makes me feel more and more uneasy

394
00:23:04.383 --> 00:23:06.385
I didn't hide anything from you

395
00:23:06.468 --> 00:23:09.054
What's so unsettling? Really?

396
00:23:11.891 --> 00:23:14.768
So what are you going to do in this house?

397
00:23:17.563 --> 00:23:20.024
before we find an office

398
00:23:20.107 --> 00:23:21.901
Planning to work from home

399
00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:23.944
Pack

400
00:23:24.028 --> 00:23:26.655
There is also delivery

401
00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:28.699
yes

402
00:23:32.036 --> 00:23:33.746
Is Ms. Hana coming too?

403
00:23:34.914 --> 00:23:35.998
yes

404
00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:40.044
I'll help with the housework while we work

405
00:23:40.127 --> 00:23:41.962
Let's help together

406
00:23:45.507 --> 00:23:46.383
OK

407
00:23:48.552 --> 00:23:51.639
You already knew all this?

408
00:23:52.264 --> 00:23:53.807
Of course not

409
00:23:54.892 --> 00:23:56.685
Not all know

410
00:23:57.603 --> 00:23:59.438
only know some

411
00:24:09.406 --> 00:24:12.451
Okay, you three, work hard. I don’t care.

412
00:24:12.534 --> 00:24:13.953
It's up to you to decide

413
00:24:14.036 --> 00:24:17.206
Why are there three people? There are only two of them and I don’t...

414
00:24:21.669 --> 00:24:22.586
Really terrible

415
00:24:23.212 --> 00:24:25.965
Dad, I have thought this through carefully.

416
00:24:27.257 --> 00:24:28.884
How much do you plan to sell it for?

417
00:24:29.927 --> 00:24:34.098
About 78,000 won

418
00:24:42.856 --> 00:24:44.775
(Recruitment: 3 million won per month)

419
00:24:57.079 --> 00:24:58.080
Oh my God, I was shocked.

420
00:24:58.914 --> 00:24:59.832
Who are you?

421
00:25:04.003 --> 00:25:05.754
What's the matter?

422
00:25:07.339 --> 00:25:10.134
- Forget it
- Tell me what's going on?

423
00:25:14.722 --> 00:25:17.558
If you don't mind, could I just say a few words?

424
00:25:17.641 --> 00:25:18.934
OK, you say it

425
00:25:23.022 --> 00:25:24.273
There's no chance of this

426
00:25:24.773 --> 00:25:26.025
Who would spend three million to rent here?

427
00:25:26.108 --> 00:25:28.694
If you are a tenant
Would you spend so much money to rent a place like this?

428
00:25:32.114 --> 00:25:33.449
How much is appropriate?

429
00:25:33.532 --> 00:25:36.201
How can you think about collecting rent right now?

430
00:25:36.285 --> 00:25:38.120
"First year rent free"

431
00:25:38.829 --> 00:25:40.539
Even so, I don't think anyone would be willing to rent it.

432
00:25:42.541 --> 00:25:45.169
Do you know how much this place costs?

433
00:25:45.252 --> 00:25:46.295
Between 1.0 and 1.1 billion won

434
00:25:47.337 --> 00:25:48.213
Wait, how did you...

435
00:25:51.550 --> 00:25:52.885
Are you a relevant person?

436
00:25:52.968 --> 00:25:54.928
Well, I am...

437
00:25:56.805 --> 00:25:58.724
- It has something to do with it
-What does "somewhat related" mean?

438
00:25:59.850 --> 00:26:01.727
What kind of relationship is there?

439
00:26:01.810 --> 00:26:04.396
Tell me what do you mean?

440
00:26:04.480 --> 00:26:05.481
Could it be that you are...

441
00:26:05.564 --> 00:26:07.816
Wait, are you...

442
00:26:14.323 --> 00:26:15.407
(Luo Dalong, psychiatrist)

443
00:26:15.491 --> 00:26:16.450
(Huiyin Psychiatric Clinic)

444
00:26:17.076 --> 00:26:19.453
You are from the psychiatric clinic on the second floor

445
00:26:19.953 --> 00:26:21.663
Doctor

446
00:26:24.917 --> 00:26:26.043
I understand

447
00:26:26.126 --> 00:26:29.046
If this building does well, you can have more patients

448
00:26:29.129 --> 00:26:31.548
That's why you're telling me what to do

449
00:26:31.632 --> 00:26:33.717
My clinic won't bother you

450
00:26:33.801 --> 00:26:36.220
Patients prefer it when the surrounding area is quiet.

451
00:26:36.887 --> 00:26:38.222
Really? Then why are you nosy?

452
00:26:38.305 --> 00:26:39.473
because

453
00:26:40.182 --> 00:26:42.559
It seems you haven't accepted the reality yet

454
00:26:42.643 --> 00:26:44.269
What reality should we accept?

455
00:26:44.353 --> 00:26:46.939
This shop is not worth the monthly rent of three million.

456
00:26:54.238 --> 00:26:55.322
accept reality

457
00:26:57.491 --> 00:26:59.409
What difference does it make if I accept it or not?

458
00:26:59.493 --> 00:27:00.661
Of course there is a difference

459
00:27:00.744 --> 00:27:03.080
Because acceptance is the first step to solving problems

460
00:27:03.747 --> 00:27:07.042
"Acceptance... is problem solving..."

461
00:27:07.626 --> 00:27:10.796
So you sit in the clinic all day talking nonsense

462
00:27:10.879 --> 00:27:13.006
Yeah, really

463
00:27:18.178 --> 00:27:19.346
It seems you haven't gone yet

464
00:27:20.305 --> 00:27:21.431
Where to go?

465
00:27:22.975 --> 00:27:25.269
Come to the second floor if you have time and let’s chat.

466
00:27:27.354 --> 00:27:28.564
What's there to talk about?

467
00:27:29.189 --> 00:27:30.649
Why should I go there?

468
00:27:32.401 --> 00:27:33.610
It's ridiculous

469
00:27:38.240 --> 00:27:41.910
Okay, the car has been safely parked by the flower bed.

470
00:27:41.994 --> 00:27:43.495
I'll have to trouble you later

471
00:27:44.121 --> 00:27:45.539
Miss Kim Na-kyung?

472
00:27:45.622 --> 00:27:46.915
- What?
- your letter

473
00:27:46.999 --> 00:27:48.250
- thank you
- You're welcome

474
00:27:48.333 --> 00:27:49.668
Sorry

475
00:27:50.252 --> 00:27:52.796
Is it inappropriate for you to run errands and buy coffee?

476
00:27:54.047 --> 00:27:56.466
It’s okay, I happen to want to buy it too. Do you want hot American style?

477
00:27:56.550 --> 00:27:57.718
I want...

478
00:27:58.594 --> 00:28:00.053
You parked at the wrong flower bed

479
00:28:00.137 --> 00:28:02.806
Really? Sorry, I will stop again later.

480
00:28:02.890 --> 00:28:04.057
- What do you want?
- Iced American

481
00:28:04.141 --> 00:28:06.393
Fruity acid flavor. Add a portion of concentrate and give me points.

482
00:28:06.476 --> 00:28:09.563
This time you did say "fruit acid flavor"

483
00:28:09.646 --> 00:28:10.647
go ahead

484
00:28:11.607 --> 00:28:12.858
- Sorry
- OK

485
00:28:12.941 --> 00:28:14.610
How did he...

486
00:28:14.693 --> 00:28:16.028
Hey hubby

487
00:28:16.111 --> 00:28:18.822
Representative Han, have you not reached agreement on communication with Namo?

488
00:28:18.906 --> 00:28:22.409
They tried it out and then withdrew.

489
00:28:22.492 --> 00:28:25.078
All our hard work over the past few months has been in vain.

490
00:28:25.162 --> 00:28:26.330
So what to do now?

491
00:28:26.413 --> 00:28:29.791
To be honest, rather than relying on a company like Namo Communications

492
00:28:29.875 --> 00:28:33.212
It’s better to contact big companies directly
That's much more efficient

493
00:28:33.295 --> 00:28:34.421
do you want

494
00:28:35.631 --> 00:28:39.218
Send your quick payment
Connect to their membership points system, right?

495
00:28:49.770 --> 00:28:50.979
Do you want me

496
00:28:51.563 --> 00:28:54.149
Schedule a meeting with ACT?

497
00:28:57.611 --> 00:28:58.654
thank you

498
00:28:58.737 --> 00:29:00.989
- This cup of mine has no sour taste, right?
- That's right

499
00:29:01.073 --> 00:29:02.324
Good

500
00:29:02.407 --> 00:29:05.118
I will be responsible for all preparations

501
00:29:05.619 --> 00:29:07.287
I will also do the demonstration part

502
00:29:07.371 --> 00:29:09.957
Brother-in-law, as long as this deal can be negotiated

503
00:29:10.040 --> 00:29:11.583
I give you

504
00:29:12.292 --> 00:29:13.710
10% of sales as commission

505
00:29:18.465 --> 00:29:19.549
Okay, take 10%

506
00:29:20.175 --> 00:29:21.134
How much is that?

507
00:29:22.177 --> 00:29:25.847
I will also fire the current sales director

508
00:29:25.931 --> 00:29:26.848
Brother-in-law, please come and take charge

509
00:29:27.683 --> 00:29:30.143
I heard it was him
I have been working on Naimo Communication for half a year in vain.

510
00:29:31.603 --> 00:29:34.439
As far as I know, the ACT sales team today
The one who is really in charge is

511
00:29:34.523 --> 00:29:36.358
Minister Du Zhenyu

512
00:29:36.441 --> 00:29:38.568
What is your relationship with him?

513
00:29:38.652 --> 00:29:41.697
Please, he is my junior
Can't catch my eye at all

514
00:29:41.780 --> 00:29:43.699
Really?

515
00:29:43.782 --> 00:29:45.784
That kid used to be trained by me every day

516
00:29:47.744 --> 00:29:49.371
That's good

517
00:29:49.454 --> 00:29:51.623
If that's the case

518
00:29:51.707 --> 00:29:53.250
Then I'll start working today, okay?

519
00:29:55.252 --> 00:29:56.461
- No need to stand up
- brother-in-law

520
00:29:56.545 --> 00:29:58.463
- We're counting on you
- OK

521
00:29:58.547 --> 00:30:00.299
- That's too polite.
- Please

522
00:30:00.841 --> 00:30:03.719
If I want to work, I need a desk.

523
00:30:03.802 --> 00:30:05.304
Okay, I'll prepare it for my brother-in-law right away

524
00:30:05.387 --> 00:30:08.265
Desk, we'll arrange it now

525
00:30:08.348 --> 00:30:09.850
You can work here first

526
00:30:11.560 --> 00:30:12.602
Can be used...

527
00:30:12.686 --> 00:30:14.313
10%

528
00:30:15.272 --> 00:30:16.815
(Quick payment access solution)

529
00:30:27.534 --> 00:30:29.494
How is Chengjiu?

530
00:30:30.245 --> 00:30:32.080
November is too late

531
00:30:32.164 --> 00:30:34.333
Du Zhenyu said he couldn't spare the time?

532
00:30:35.042 --> 00:30:36.626
Can't you think of a way?

533
00:30:36.710 --> 00:30:38.253
Please tell me more

534
00:30:38.337 --> 00:30:39.379
OK

535
00:30:39.880 --> 00:30:41.298
OK thank you

536
00:30:43.008 --> 00:30:45.093
