00:46:10.768 --> 00:46:12.937
You called in the morning
Just for me to be the driver, right?

806
00:46:15.106 --> 00:46:17.024
It was you who took the initiative to drive

807
00:46:17.108 --> 00:46:19.110
I've always been very good at reading people.

808
00:46:20.361 --> 00:46:23.698
I still clearly remember the first time I saw you

809
00:46:23.781 --> 00:46:24.907
What are you doing?

810
00:46:24.991 --> 00:46:28.244
"This guy is a poisonous snake who adapts to the wind.

811
00:46:29.036 --> 00:46:31.080
We definitely don’t get along.”

812
00:46:32.164 --> 00:46:33.916
Hey, this is unavoidable...

813
00:46:34.000 --> 00:46:35.501
It's strange to say that I just don't like you.

814
00:46:36.335 --> 00:46:39.630
So I haven't saved your number yet. Do you understand?

815
00:46:39.714 --> 00:46:42.216
Brother-in-law, if you do this again

816
00:46:43.050 --> 00:46:44.552
It’s not like I don’t have any grudges

817
00:46:44.635 --> 00:46:46.053
I'm not interested in listening

818
00:46:46.554 --> 00:46:48.597
You two seem to be quite compatible.

819
00:46:48.681 --> 00:46:50.391
Minister Du is also a poisonous snake

820
00:46:50.474 --> 00:46:51.767
You two should work together well

821
00:46:53.477 --> 00:46:54.770
But in the end

822
00:46:55.563 --> 00:46:57.023
You will reap the consequences

823
00:46:58.399 --> 00:46:59.734
You little snake and scorpion villain

824
00:47:02.486 --> 00:47:03.362
brother-in-law

825
00:47:03.988 --> 00:47:04.905
Brother-in-law!

826
00:47:21.047 --> 00:47:23.966
(ACT pass)

827
00:47:40.191 --> 00:47:41.067
(NTC Bank)

828
00:47:41.150 --> 00:47:44.403
(October loan interest payment notice
Interest amount: 3208333)

829
00:48:31.158 --> 00:48:32.201
Hey Soo Kyum

830
00:48:32.743 --> 00:48:34.578
- What?
- When are you going to do this?

831
00:48:35.830 --> 00:48:36.831
This is it

832
00:48:37.456 --> 00:48:40.000
I don’t know. I’m also wondering when it will be sold out.

833
00:48:46.757 --> 00:48:48.509
- Kim Soo-gyeom
- Huh?

834
00:48:48.592 --> 00:48:50.678
What did I tell you when I gave you the money?

835
00:48:50.761 --> 00:48:52.179
answer me

836
00:48:52.721 --> 00:48:54.890
When I give you 30 million
What did I tell you?

837
00:48:58.102 --> 00:48:59.812
You let me go to school well

838
00:48:59.895 --> 00:49:02.523
Then how long will you continue to toss?

839
00:49:03.232 --> 00:49:05.860
This kind of game of house
How long do you want to play?

840
00:49:08.446 --> 00:49:09.488
dad

841
00:49:10.364 --> 00:49:12.283
I know it’s not easy for you to make money

842
00:49:13.117 --> 00:49:16.829
That’s why I want to make money quickly so I can pay it back to you.

843
00:49:17.746 --> 00:49:18.622
I just...

844
00:49:22.001 --> 00:49:23.335
sorry

845
00:49:26.088 --> 00:49:28.382
That's not what I want to hear

846
00:49:29.758 --> 00:49:30.968
Soo Kyum

847
00:49:31.051 --> 00:49:34.013
You have to go out on your own, take risks, and run into walls.

848
00:49:34.096 --> 00:49:35.347
OK I understand

849
00:49:36.015 --> 00:49:38.934
But if you are overwhelmed by debt,
Do you know what the consequences will be?

850
00:49:40.352 --> 00:49:42.563
Eventually you will lose yourself

851
00:49:43.189 --> 00:49:46.317
You will forget who you are and why you set out in the first place

852
00:49:46.400 --> 00:49:47.860
This is more terrible than losing money

853
00:49:48.486 --> 00:49:51.489
No matter what, you must stay
In that circle where everyone has

854
00:49:52.573 --> 00:49:54.742
Even if you think it's not cool enough

855
00:49:54.825 --> 00:49:56.410
Not great at all

856
00:49:57.161 --> 00:49:59.747
But in the end, the only thing that can protect you is that circle

857
00:49:59.830 --> 00:50:00.706
dad

858
00:50:02.791 --> 00:50:04.043
But that circle

859
00:50:05.169 --> 00:50:06.712
Didn't protect you

860
00:50:09.423 --> 00:50:11.926
Send you to a remote place to suffer

861
00:50:13.010 --> 00:50:14.678
And kicked you out

862
00:50:17.097 --> 00:50:18.098
Did you expect this?

863
00:50:20.726 --> 00:50:21.769
No

864
00:50:23.229 --> 00:50:25.564
You can't even protect yourself

865
00:50:28.108 --> 00:50:31.779
Why are you so sure about my future?

866
00:50:45.709 --> 00:50:47.878
you are right

867
00:50:49.046 --> 00:50:50.965
I'm not qualified to say these words

868
00:50:52.049 --> 00:50:53.884
I didn't mean that

869
00:50:53.968 --> 00:50:54.885
hey listen

870
00:50:55.553 --> 00:50:58.013
Wait until dad finds a good job and makes a lot of money

871
00:50:58.097 --> 00:51:00.140
You have to listen to dad then, okay?

872
00:51:01.183 --> 00:51:03.477
- Dad, I...
- Just keep working. Sorry to bother you.

873
00:51:04.228 --> 00:51:05.938
Dad, I really am not that...

874
00:51:09.775 --> 00:51:10.943
When did you come back?

875
00:51:11.694 --> 00:51:13.821
I came back early today

876
00:51:17.992 --> 00:51:19.368
you need to eat something

877
00:51:19.451 --> 00:51:20.869
After eating, I went to take a shower

878
00:51:22.329 --> 00:51:23.205
Husband

879
00:51:25.874 --> 00:51:27.167
Is nothing wrong?

880
00:51:29.003 --> 00:51:30.921
I hope something happens

881
00:51:33.465 --> 00:51:34.383
I'm fine

882
00:52:24.266 --> 00:52:25.643
Yes I'm on my way

883
00:52:25.726 --> 00:52:26.977
OK

884
00:52:27.061 --> 00:52:30.356
Arrive in ten minutes. Please wait.

885
00:52:34.276 --> 00:52:36.654
Is this the driver you ordered?

886
00:52:36.737 --> 00:52:38.697
- Yes
- OK

887
00:52:39.782 --> 00:52:43.035
Sorry
Can I put the scooter in the trunk?

888
00:52:43.118 --> 00:52:44.620
OK, go ahead

889
00:52:44.703 --> 00:52:46.622
Great. Thank you. Please get in the car.

890
00:53:01.345 --> 00:53:02.805
Re-routing in progress

891
00:53:02.888 --> 00:53:03.889
(turn left)

892
00:53:07.101 --> 00:53:09.269
How many times has this happened?

893
00:53:09.353 --> 00:53:11.897
- Sorry, Master.
- What?

894
00:53:12.398 --> 00:53:14.024
Can't you see the navigation?

895
00:53:14.108 --> 00:53:16.485
You should have turned left just now

896
00:53:17.027 --> 00:53:19.363
I'm really sorry. I'll be there in a minute.

897
00:53:32.626 --> 00:53:34.336
Arrived

898
00:53:38.048 --> 00:53:39.717
thank you

899
00:53:41.885 --> 00:53:43.303
Where is this?

900
00:54:21.091 --> 00:54:22.009
(Waiting for order)

901
00:54:22.968 --> 00:54:23.844
great

902
00:54:24.428 --> 00:54:26.138
200,000 won

903
00:54:26.221 --> 00:54:27.306
What? Go to Liangshui?

904
00:54:28.432 --> 00:54:30.434
Then it will be difficult to come back

905
00:54:31.727 --> 00:54:32.978
Let's go. Where are the people?

906
00:54:33.061 --> 00:54:34.480
(No. 19, Junggi-ro 9-gil, Gangnam-gu, Seoul)

907
00:54:34.646 --> 00:54:36.732
Why is it here? Damn it

908
00:54:38.734 --> 00:54:40.736
(Dudali Restaurant)

909
00:54:45.073 --> 00:54:47.910
Oh my God, he orders instant noodles every time

910
00:54:47.993 --> 00:54:49.244
Let's order grilled fish

911
00:54:49.328 --> 00:54:50.579
- They have squid
- Instant noodles

912
00:54:50.662 --> 00:54:52.664
- Okay, then squid
- I want this

913
00:54:52.748 --> 00:54:55.459
- Instant noodles
- Hey

914
00:54:55.542 --> 00:54:56.668
hey

915
00:54:59.213 --> 00:55:01.215
This is not cuttlefish at all

916
00:55:01.298 --> 00:55:03.091
- How are you going to drive...
- Is it a driving service?

917
00:55:03.801 --> 00:55:05.928
- Yes
- Okay, I'm leaving.

918
00:55:06.011 --> 00:55:08.055
You kid, wait a minute, when did you call for a driver?

919
00:55:08.138 --> 00:55:09.223
Where are you going?

920
00:55:09.306 --> 00:55:11.850
Hey I gotta go

921
00:55:11.934 --> 00:55:14.812
Sorry, those bastards

922
00:55:14.895 --> 00:55:16.146
- Hey you...
- let's go

923
00:55:16.230 --> 00:55:17.105
good

924
00:55:17.189 --> 00:55:19.691
That black car across the street is mine.

925
00:55:19.775 --> 00:55:21.985
- Minister
- What? Minister?

926
00:55:22.402 --> 00:55:23.445
Minister?

927
00:55:26.907 --> 00:55:27.908
master

928
00:55:27.991 --> 00:55:30.744
I'm exhausted

929
00:55:30.828 --> 00:55:31.703
good

930
00:55:33.372 --> 00:55:36.041
Seriously, why are you so drunk?

931
00:55:36.124 --> 00:55:38.126
He's my friend. Say hello.

932
00:55:38.210 --> 00:55:39.253
We're leaving now. Goodbye.

933
00:55:39.336 --> 00:55:41.672
- let's go
- The car is over there!

934
00:55:41.755 --> 00:55:43.507
- Over there?
- Go that way

935
00:55:43.590 --> 00:55:44.466
Let’s go!

936
00:55:44.550 --> 00:55:46.718
Okay, Master Jin will drive you home tonight

937
00:55:46.802 --> 00:55:48.220
ok?

938
00:55:48.303 --> 00:55:50.305
Contact me later. Thank you for your hard work today.

939
00:55:50.389 --> 00:55:51.557
Okay, thank you for your hard work

940
00:55:51.640 --> 00:55:53.392
Why are you doing this to me, Master?

941
00:55:53.475 --> 00:55:55.853
I invite you for the second round!

942
00:56:05.404 --> 00:56:07.155
(Go straight for 8 kilometers)

943
00:56:10.409 --> 00:56:11.827
What's going on?

944
00:56:13.495 --> 00:56:15.956
I got a call from you guy so late.

945
00:56:16.039 --> 00:56:18.125
I'm already very unhappy

946
00:56:18.709 --> 00:56:20.711
What's going on, Minister Kim?

947
00:56:22.588 --> 00:56:26.216
Didn't you say everything has been checked, Minister Kim?

948
00:56:31.346 --> 00:56:32.556
Hello

949
00:56:32.639 --> 00:56:38.020
I asked you to double-check it, right?

950
00:56:38.103 --> 00:56:40.981
There's a meeting tomorrow

951
00:56:41.648 --> 00:56:44.192
With your virtue, what responsibility can you bear?

952
00:56:45.068 --> 00:56:48.864
What will you do at your age?

953
00:56:49.656 --> 00:56:53.493
I'll hand in my resignation letter tomorrow morning

954
00:56:53.577 --> 00:56:55.120
No negotiation

955
00:56:55.203 --> 00:56:58.415
I'll give you a big severance package

956
00:56:58.498 --> 00:57:01.168
Go run your own business

957
00:57:01.251 --> 00:57:04.254
Open a fried chicken restaurant and I will order your takeout every day

958
00:57:04.963 --> 00:57:07.466
That's enough, you bastard, shut up!

959
00:57:07.549 --> 00:57:10.302
I've had enough of you!

960
00:57:10.385 --> 00:57:11.637
Asshole you have to...

961
00:57:13.931 --> 00:57:18.810
That's right, you have to let the driver
I need to give you a good lesson.

962
00:57:18.894 --> 00:57:21.897
Master, please let this bastard clear his head.

963
00:57:21.980 --> 00:57:23.982
Give him a few scoldings for me

964
00:57:24.066 --> 00:57:25.734
Sir, don't do this

965
00:57:25.817 --> 00:57:27.945
I'm going crazy with anger

966
00:57:28.695 --> 00:57:31.365
Just scold him happily

967
00:57:31.448 --> 00:57:32.908
Just curse

968
00:57:34.284 --> 00:57:35.494
Don't do this, sir

969
00:57:35.577 --> 00:57:39.456
Let's do this. Just scold him and I'll give you an extra 200,000 yuan.

970
00:57:39.957 --> 00:57:43.585
I can get 200,000 for swearing. Is that a good deal?

971
00:57:44.670 --> 00:57:47.339
Are you okay?

972
00:57:47.422 --> 00:57:49.174
He said yes

973
00:57:49.257 --> 00:57:51.802
Just scold him!

974
00:57:51.885 --> 00:57:53.804
Executive: You are too drunk.

975
00:57:53.887 --> 00:57:56.431
Shut up and listen!

976
00:57:56.515 --> 00:57:57.766
Do you know?

977
00:57:59.142 --> 00:58:00.560
master

978
00:58:00.644 --> 00:58:04.022
You don’t want an extra 200,000?

979
00:58:04.106 --> 00:58:06.858
That adds up to 400,000!

980
00:58:07.693 --> 00:58:08.568
Oops!

981
00:58:12.698 --> 00:58:13.824
wake up

982
00:58:13.907 --> 00:58:17.160
Damn it, I told you to scold him!

983
00:58:17.244 --> 00:58:18.954
You bastard!

984
00:58:19.830 --> 00:58:21.081
"You bastard..."

985
00:58:24.292 --> 00:58:26.920
Hello Minister Kim

986
00:58:27.004 --> 00:58:30.132
Please wake up

987
00:58:30.632 --> 00:58:33.802
Have you spent all your years living in a dog's belly?

988
00:58:34.344 --> 00:58:38.724
If it weren't for me, you would have been fired long ago

989
00:58:39.433 --> 00:58:41.810
Work hard for me, you know?

990
00:58:41.893 --> 00:58:43.061
Hello

991
00:58:44.980 --> 00:58:45.856
(Construction ahead, slow down)

992
00:59:48.043 --> 00:59:55.008
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

993
01:00:25.080 --> 01:00:27.874
{\an8}So Madam doesn’t know yet
What happened when you bought the shop on the first floor?

994
01:00:27.958 --> 01:00:29.084
{\an8}Boss!

995
01:00:29.167 --> 01:00:30.127
{\an8}No water left

996
01:00:30.210 --> 01:00:31.086
{\an8}Sorry, Dr. Luo

997
01:00:31.169 --> 01:00:32.629
{\an8}I think he is as stupid as me

998
01:00:32.712 --> 01:00:33.839
{\an8}I can’t trust that guy

999
01:00:33.922 --> 01:00:37.968
{\an8}This apartment embodies my 51 years of hard work

1000
01:00:38.051 --> 01:00:38.927
{\an8}Dad, you are the best!

1001
01:00:40.137 --> 01:00:41.721
{\an8}-Who?
- So he was kicked out

1002
01:00:42.222 --> 01:00:45.100
{\an8}How do you feel when you hear this?

1003
01:00:45.183 --> 01:00:46.726
{\an8}I am seeing a doctor

1004
01:00:46.810 --> 01:00:49.187
{\an8}Sitting face to face with a complete stranger...

1005
01:00:49.271 --> 01:00:51.398
{\an8}I really can’t do it

1006
01:00:51.481 --> 01:00:54.693
{\an8}Do you two regard me as family?

1007
01:00:54.776 --> 01:00:56.778
{\an8}Sober up, Kim Nak-soo!

1008
01:01:00.557 --> 01:01:02.557
Subtitle translation: Jia Xue

